WEBVTT

00:00:06.099 --> 00:00:07.308
(screams, grunts)

00:00:07.392 --> 00:00:10.478
-Ellie, behind you!
-What's happening?

00:00:15.108 --> 00:00:16.442
MANNY: Go to the land bridge.

00:00:16.526 --> 00:00:18.361
You'll be safe
on the other side.

00:00:18.444 --> 00:00:19.946
No, Manny! No!

00:00:20.029 --> 00:00:21.406
I'll meet you there.

00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:23.157
-Whoa!
-Aah!

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:25.159
(screams, grunts)

00:00:25.243 --> 00:00:26.369
(screaming)

00:00:26.786 --> 00:00:29.080
(grunts, screams)

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:35.128
Manny! No!

00:00:35.628 --> 00:00:36.462
Ellie!

00:00:36.546 --> 00:00:38.047
You have to get
out of here.

00:00:38.131 --> 00:00:40.008
Go. Go now.

00:00:46.347 --> 00:00:47.181
(grunts)

00:00:50.727 --> 00:00:52.228
(grunts)

00:00:53.438 --> 00:00:55.273
-Mom!
-Get back! Get back!

00:00:55.356 --> 00:00:57.108
(gasps)

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.421
(groaning)

00:01:18.504 --> 00:01:20.715
(sniffling, whimpering)

00:01:21.466 --> 00:01:23.134
Daddy!

00:01:25.136 --> 00:01:27.430
Stay alive!

00:01:27.764 --> 00:01:29.766
No matter how long it takes,

00:01:29.849 --> 00:01:32.143
I will find you!

00:01:32.477 --> 00:01:33.436
(sniffles)
Mom,

00:01:33.519 --> 00:01:35.438
this is all my fault.

00:01:35.521 --> 00:01:36.481
If I had just listened...

00:01:36.564 --> 00:01:38.942
Peaches, this is not
your fault, okay?

00:01:39.025 --> 00:01:40.735
What if I never
see him again?

00:01:40.818 --> 00:01:42.362
And the last thing
we did was fight.

00:01:42.445 --> 00:01:44.906
Hey, your father
is the toughest,

00:01:44.989 --> 00:01:46.741
most stubborn mammoth
I've ever met.

00:01:46.824 --> 00:01:48.534
He'll come back for us.

00:01:48.618 --> 00:01:49.953
That's a promise.

00:01:52.997 --> 00:01:54.499
(panting)

00:01:54.582 --> 00:01:55.792
(grunts)

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:58.294
Come on! Help me turn
this thing around!

00:01:59.253 --> 00:02:00.505
(grunting)

00:02:03.174 --> 00:02:05.885
(all screaming)

00:02:05.969 --> 00:02:07.929
(deep rumbling)

00:02:08.012 --> 00:02:10.056
ELLIE: Everyone, please, settle down!

00:02:10.139 --> 00:02:11.391
Don't panic!

00:02:11.474 --> 00:02:12.600
(gobbling wildly)

00:02:12.684 --> 00:02:14.227
Wait, Mom, where's Louis?

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:15.395
We have to find him.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:17.855
Okay, fast.

00:02:18.398 --> 00:02:19.440
-(animals gasp)
-Where they going?

00:02:20.525 --> 00:02:22.694
(Manny grunting with effort)

00:02:25.363 --> 00:02:26.197
Whew!

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:28.199
They need me!
We got to get back.

00:02:28.533 --> 00:02:30.076
Buddy, this thing's
too big to turn.

00:02:30.159 --> 00:02:31.828
The current's pulling us out.

00:02:32.203 --> 00:02:34.038
You know, my mother
once told me that bad news

00:02:34.122 --> 00:02:35.957
was just good news in disguise.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.709
Was this before
she abandoned you?

00:02:37.792 --> 00:02:39.085
Yes, it was.

00:02:39.168 --> 00:02:42.046
But the point being, that
even though things look bad,

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:44.048
there's a rainbow
round every corner...

00:02:44.132 --> 00:02:45.216
(wind whistling,
thunder rumbling)

00:02:45.299 --> 00:02:48.761
...and nothing but
smooth sailing ahead!

00:02:48.845 --> 00:02:49.804
(gasps)

00:02:49.887 --> 00:02:50.805
(thunder rumbling)

00:02:53.307 --> 00:02:54.434
Smooth sailing, Sid?

00:03:03.317 --> 00:03:05.069
-Louis? Louis?
-Louis?

00:03:05.153 --> 00:03:08.322
-Wiener? Wiener?
-Wiener? Wiener?

00:03:08.406 --> 00:03:09.699
Louis, where are you?

00:03:10.033 --> 00:03:11.284
Come on, we have to go!

00:03:12.702 --> 00:03:13.953
(panting anxiously)

00:03:17.498 --> 00:03:20.001
-Louis?
-Peaches! Aah!

00:03:20.084 --> 00:03:21.461
(gasps)

00:03:21.878 --> 00:03:23.963
Louis, you have to jump!

00:03:24.047 --> 00:03:25.173
(gasps, shrieks)

00:03:25.256 --> 00:03:27.341
No! Go, save yourselves!

00:03:27.425 --> 00:03:29.177
We're not leaving without you!

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:30.178
Oh, thank goodness.

00:03:30.261 --> 00:03:31.095
Jump!

00:03:32.138 --> 00:03:33.181
(shrieks)

00:03:33.556 --> 00:03:35.725
(screaming)

00:03:36.893 --> 00:03:39.353
This is why
I travel underground!

00:03:40.021 --> 00:03:40.980
(screams)

00:03:41.064 --> 00:03:42.106
(grunts)

00:03:47.111 --> 00:03:48.362
Thanks for coming back.

00:03:48.446 --> 00:03:49.655
What do you mean?

00:03:49.739 --> 00:03:51.365
You don't leave
a friend behind.

00:03:51.908 --> 00:03:53.576
Great. Let's go.

00:03:54.285 --> 00:03:56.954
That wall is gonna keep moving
and crush us.

00:03:57.038 --> 00:03:59.082
We need to get
to the land bridge.

00:03:59.165 --> 00:04:00.291
Any questions?

00:04:00.374 --> 00:04:01.375
Ooh, ooh!

00:04:01.793 --> 00:04:02.919
Yes?

00:04:03.002 --> 00:04:05.004
When you drink water
through your trunk,

00:04:05.088 --> 00:04:07.256
does it taste like boogers?

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:09.008
Uh, no.

00:04:09.092 --> 00:04:11.094
Well, sometimes.
Let's move!

00:04:11.969 --> 00:04:12.929
(animals murmuring)

00:04:13.513 --> 00:04:14.639
(both gasp)

00:04:19.268 --> 00:04:22.730
(lightning crackling,
thunder rumbling)

00:04:23.606 --> 00:04:24.524
-Whoa, whoa!
-Whoa, whoa! Whoa, whoa!

00:04:24.607 --> 00:04:27.735
Just keep your eye
on the horizon!

00:04:27.819 --> 00:04:30.404
I can't find
the horizon!

00:04:34.992 --> 00:04:36.953
(roaring)

00:04:37.036 --> 00:04:38.788
(gasps)
Holy crab!

00:04:39.872 --> 00:04:41.457
(roaring)

00:04:41.916 --> 00:04:42.875
(screams)

00:04:43.543 --> 00:04:44.418
(panting)

00:04:45.461 --> 00:04:46.462
(screams)

00:04:46.879 --> 00:04:48.339
-(crab gasps)
-Huh?

00:04:52.343 --> 00:04:54.053
(screams)
Hold me!

00:04:54.137 --> 00:04:55.304
(Manny screaming)

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.390
SID: If I don't make it,

00:04:57.473 --> 00:05:00.810
find me a wife
and tell her I love her!

00:05:02.228 --> 00:05:04.021
(all screaming)

00:05:10.027 --> 00:05:11.821
(gasps)
We made it.

00:05:11.904 --> 00:05:15.283
Come on, ocean.
Is that the best you can do?

00:05:15.366 --> 00:05:16.784
Am I right, buddy?

00:05:17.118 --> 00:05:18.077
(screams)

00:05:18.161 --> 00:05:20.454
(wind whistling)

00:05:20.538 --> 00:05:21.539
(screaming)

00:05:24.375 --> 00:05:26.627
(all screaming)

00:05:32.258 --> 00:05:33.092
Hey.

00:05:33.176 --> 00:05:35.636
There really is a rainbow
around every corner.

00:05:37.847 --> 00:05:39.640
(all screaming)

00:05:43.811 --> 00:05:45.730
(animals conversing)

00:05:51.068 --> 00:05:52.403
(sighs)

00:05:52.486 --> 00:05:54.280
-Peaches!
-Whoa!

00:05:56.949 --> 00:05:57.783
(panting)

00:06:00.578 --> 00:06:01.787
You okay?

00:06:02.288 --> 00:06:04.207
I'm just so worried
about my dad.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:05.958
Listen, we're gonna
get to him.

00:06:06.042 --> 00:06:07.919
At this pace,
we'll stay ahead of the wall

00:06:08.002 --> 00:06:10.087
and we'll make it to the
land bridge before you know it.

00:06:11.339 --> 00:06:13.883
We're all gonna survive this.

00:06:13.966 --> 00:06:15.301
(Crash & Eddie laughing)

00:06:16.469 --> 00:06:17.720
(screaming)

00:06:18.346 --> 00:06:19.847
Okay, maybe they won't,

00:06:19.931 --> 00:06:22.391
but everyone else,
totally fine.

00:06:22.475 --> 00:06:24.185
(both whimper and groan)

